#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Items, files and bytes upstream (273,559 items, 1,057,223 files, 361.55 GiB as last transcribed), the storage target for each kind of file, and a request rate IRIS will tolerate. A budget with no denominator is a preference, not a limit."
msgstr ""

