#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Not published, not retried silently. The record keeps its reference to IRIS and the bitstream is marked unknown."
msgstr ""

#: ../who-iris/processes/iris-cdn-initial-load.bpmn:56
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Object storage behind the CDN. Every object is named by its SHA-256 and served with an immutable cache policy; an object already present is never written again. Also serves did.json."
msgstr ""

#: ../who-iris/processes/iris-cdn-initial-load.bpmn:70
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "One batch per collection (large collections split by page). The plan and its progress are a checkpoint file in the Cloudflare git repository (state/initial-load.json); restarting reads it and skips finished batches."
msgstr ""

