msgstr ""

#: ../who-iris/processes/iris-cdn-initial-load.bpmn:32
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "The first full export of WHO IRIS onto Cloudflare (git on Artifacts, bytes in R2): every item record and every bitstream: metadata plus PDFs. Run in batches with a checkpoint, so a run that stops resumes where it stopped and never re-fetches what it already holds. Ends in one signed, verified release."
msgstr ""

